          "title": "A Letter from Zib",
          "text": "Dear friend, On Bix, it is cold in the snow. I wear mittens. It is hot on the hill. I wear sunscreen. I like the rain best. After the rain, I see a rainbow in the sky! Your friend, Zib",
          "questions": [
